          "Scope save, dirty state, and history per graph",
          "Render and persist cross-graph edges",
          "Add performance and accessibility safeguards",
          "Persist workspace arrangement separately"
        ],
        "questionTitles": [
          "When should workspace state become a graph artifact?",
          "What is the supported open-graph budget?",
          "How much automatic graph placement is useful?"
        ],
        "taskListText": "1. Create the multi-document workspace state model\n2. Render visible graph regions and headers\n3. Define graph activation and focus behavior\n4. Map graph-local coordinates into the workspace\n5. Add open-alongside, close, and load lifecycle\n6. Scope save, dirty state, and history per graph\n7. Render and persist cross-graph edges\n8. Add performance and accessibility safeguards\n9. Persist workspace arrangement separately",
        "questionListText": "1. When should workspace state become a graph artifact?\n2. What is the supported open-graph budget?\n3. How much automatic graph placement is useful?",
